  "releaseNotes": "## AgentOS Core 2.0.0-beta.40\n\n- Fixes missing inline artifact downloads and output attachment cards in the product chat UI.\n- Projects persisted artifacts consistently for the product web UI and external SDK, preserving each interface's authorized download route.\n- Keeps output attachments in the final answer after closing tool calls and after reload.\n- Reuses AgentOS Runtime 1.0.0-beta.18. Existing Runtime installations and sandbox templates do not need rebuilding.\n\nOffline bundles in this Core release are Core-only upgrade packages. Fresh deployments also require the separately published Runtime 1.0.0-beta.18.",
